    "description": "Wherever you\u2019re going, take us with you.\r\n\r\nSearch, book and manage your flights anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nSEARCH & BOOK FLIGHTS \u2013 Search and book a trip to your favourite European location.\r\n\r\nMANAGE FLIGHT BOOKINGS - Keep track of your easyJet flight bookings all in one place.\r\n\r\nMOBILE BOARDING PASSES \u2013 Use your mobile boarding pass to travel through the airport quickly, speed up boarding and reduce paper waste. Save your boarding passes to Apple Wallet for easy access .\r\n\r\nMOBILE BOARDING PASSES \u2013 Use your mobile boarding pass to travel through the airport quickly, speed up boarding and reduce paper waste. Save your boarding passes to your Google Wallet for easy access.",
